473
00:38:36,733 --> 00:38:38,192
- tapi kita harus bergegas.
- Baik.

474
00:38:38,193 --> 00:38:39,319
Benarkah itu?

475
00:38:42,489 --> 00:38:43,991
Kalian menutupi sesuatu?

476
00:38:47,953 --> 00:38:50,706
Jika kutunjukkan, kalian akan pergi?

477
00:39:11,560 --> 00:39:12,644
RUTE EVAKUASI

478
00:39:14,229 --> 00:39:15,230
Bagus.

479
00:39:59,733 --> 00:40:00,817
Kentaro!

480
00:40:03,529 --> 00:40:04,821
May, minggir!

481
00:40:15,791 --> 00:40:17,084
Kau baik-baik saja?

482
00:40:19,253 --> 00:40:20,254
Ya.

483
00:40:23,966 --> 00:40:25,592
Shaw harus hidup.

484
00:41:28,322 --> 00:41:30,531
<i>Komando Monarch, ini Eagle 1.</i>

485
00:41:30,532 --> 00:41:32,576
<i>Visibilitas berkurang drastis.</i>

486
00:41:39,875 --> 00:41:40,876
Kau tak apa-apa?

487
00:41:41,460 --> 00:41:43,044
Ya, hanya…

488
00:41:43,045 --> 00:41:45,088
Aku punya pengalaman buruk
dengan helikopter.

489
00:41:46,256 --> 00:41:49,175
Dinding badai mendekat
lebih cepat dari dugaan.

490
00:41:49,176 --> 00:41:50,301
Kita harus kembali.

491
00:41:50,302 --> 00:41:51,929
Tidak, kita harus hentikan mereka.

492
00:41:53,347 --> 00:41:54,348
Maju terus.

493
00:42:12,032 --> 00:42:14,742
- Sudah menyala?
- Ayo pergi. Ada makhluk lain di sini.

494
00:42:14,743 --> 00:42:16,911
Ya, angkanya bertahan stabil.

495
00:42:16,912 --> 00:42:18,162
Waktu kita tak banyak.

496
00:42:18,163 --> 00:42:19,580
PERANGKAT SIAP
AKTIFKAN

497
00:42:19,581 --> 00:42:20,832
Lakukan sekarang atau pergi.

498
00:42:22,835 --> 00:42:23,961
Apa yang Ayah tunggu?

499
00:42:30,801 --> 00:42:31,802
Mereka di sana.

500
00:42:33,178 --> 00:42:35,222
Tak bisa mendarat.
Terlalu banyak puing.

501
00:42:37,516 --> 00:42:38,642
Cate.

502
00:42:39,768 --> 00:42:43,814
Kami menguji ini lebih dari setahun
dalam kondisi optimal

503
00:42:44,523 --> 00:42:46,149
sebelum bisa mengembalikan kalian.

504
00:42:47,693 --> 00:42:49,611
Kondisi ini tidak optimal.

505
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:51,613
Kita sedang diincar.

506
00:42:52,114 --> 00:42:54,032
Ayah bilang bisa melakukannya.

507
00:42:54,783 --> 00:42:56,284
Ayah bilang bisa mencoba.

508
00:42:56,285 --> 00:42:57,411
Cobalah!

509
00:42:59,913 --> 00:43:01,748
Kami terjatuh ke dunia lain.

510
00:43:02,457 --> 00:43:03,833
Ayah tak tahu kami hidup,

511
00:43:03,834 --> 00:43:06,044
tapi Ayah datang
dan tetap melakukan semua ini.

512
00:43:06,837 --> 00:43:08,338
Ayah melakukannya untukku.

513
00:43:10,340 --> 00:43:11,884
Aku perlu melakukannya untuk Shaw.

514
00:43:18,682 --> 00:43:21,977
Ada yang tidak beres. Aku tidak suka ini.

515
00:43:23,687 --> 00:43:25,606
Kami dibawa ke mana?

516
00:43:25,939 --> 00:43:27,149
Kita sudah sampai.

517
00:43:28,317 --> 00:43:31,820
Baiklah. Ingat. Kutunjukkan, kalian pergi.

518
00:43:32,404 --> 00:43:34,822
Setuju. Mengerti? Paham?

519
00:43:34,823 --> 00:43:36,617
- Ya?
- Ya.

520
00:43:37,534 --> 00:43:38,660
- Baik.
- Lewat sini.

521
00:44:18,534 --> 00:44:19,535
Astaga.

522
00:44:24,081 --> 00:44:29,085
Orang-orang di desa itu
menunggu tahun demi tahun

523
00:44:29,086 --> 00:44:31,338
agar dewa mereka kembali,

524
00:44:32,047 --> 00:44:36,176
untuk memberkati perairan
dan membawa hasil laut melimpah.

525
00:44:47,771 --> 00:44:49,273
Hei!

526
00:44:50,357 --> 00:44:51,482
Ayo pergi sekarang.

527
00:44:51,483 --> 00:44:53,109
Kami siap mengirim kapsulnya.

528
00:44:53,110 --> 00:44:54,652
Dinding badai mendekat.

529
00:44:54,653 --> 00:44:57,363
Jika tak pergi dalam sepuluh menit,
kita tak akan keluar.

530
00:44:57,364 --> 00:44:59,448
- Beberapa menit saja.
- Baik, ayo.

531
00:44:59,449 --> 00:45:00,825
Lekas! Ayo.

532
00:45:00,826 --> 00:45:03,578
Kau sudah berusaha, Cate.
Tapi jika membuka celah itu lagi,

533
00:45:03,579 --> 00:45:05,581
entah apa yang bisa kau lepaskan.

534
00:45:07,541 --> 00:45:11,086
Aku kehilangan satu anggota keluarga.
Aku tak mau kehilangan lagi.

535
00:45:12,171 --> 00:45:13,504
Aku mohon.

536
00:45:13,505 --> 00:45:15,132
Ayolah. Kita pergi.

537
00:45:17,509 --> 00:45:19,845
Aku memegangmu! Jangan lepaskan aku!

538
00:45:21,221 --> 00:45:22,222
Cate!

539
00:45:22,931 --> 00:45:24,057
Cate, jangan!

540
00:45:43,827 --> 00:45:45,829
Itu akan menarik kita! Kita harus pergi!

541
00:46:00,552 --> 00:46:02,054
Ya Tuhan, kumohon.

542
00:46:13,023 --> 00:46:14,358
Sial.

543
00:46:26,828 --> 00:46:27,829
Sial.

544
00:47:46,158 --> 00:47:47,492
Sial!

545
00:47:50,913 --> 00:47:52,539
Kita harus pergi!

546
00:47:58,420 --> 00:47:59,671
Cate, pegangan!

547
00:48:07,179 --> 00:48:08,471
Oh, itu gawat.

548
00:48:08,472 --> 00:48:10,848
Pergi, Semuanya. Pergi dari sini!

549
00:48:10,849 --> 00:48:12,059
Kita akan pergi!

550
00:48:49,930 --> 00:48:53,391
Dr. Randa!
Dr. Randa, kumohon, ayo pergi!

551
00:48:53,392 --> 00:48:55,769
Kita harus pergi! Kumohon!

552
00:49:01,608 --> 00:49:02,651
Astaga!

553
00:50:00,834 --> 00:50:01,877
Shaw!

554
00:50:12,513 --> 00:50:13,514
Ayo! Lekas!

555
00:50:14,598 --> 00:50:16,265
- Lee!
- Tidak. Kita harus pergi.

556
00:50:16,266 --> 00:50:17,559
Ayo!

557
00:50:21,563 --> 00:50:23,398
Ayo! Cepat! Ayo!

558
00:50:28,278 --> 00:50:30,781
Wah! Awas!

559
00:50:37,204 --> 00:50:38,454
Ayo!

560
00:50:38,455 --> 00:50:39,665
Ayo. Kita harus pergi!

561
00:50:54,555 --> 00:50:55,556
Ayo!

562
00:51:05,107 --> 00:51:06,400
Di mana Verdugo?

563
00:51:08,110 --> 00:51:10,988
Hei! Di mana Verdugo?

564
00:51:12,656 --> 00:51:14,032
Dia tewas.

565
00:51:27,504 --> 00:51:28,589
Ayo!

566
00:51:42,144 --> 00:51:43,937
Mungkin seharusnya aku ditinggalkan.

567
00:52:03,415 --> 00:52:05,125
Makhluk apa itu?

568
00:53:26,623 --> 00:53:28,625
Terjemahan subtitle oleh C. Sugiarto

